{
  "slug": "rfc-generator",
  "name": "Rfc Generator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This plugin used for generate RFC using based on user requirements",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (7): `done` (Finalize the RFC session, generate draft document, and exit RFC mode), `help` (Display help and reference for RFC commands, sections, and usage), `refine` (Iterate on the current RFC section with more depth, additional options, or softer framing), `review` (Analyze the RFC for gaps, missing options, weak trade-offs, and tone issues), `section` (Navigate to a specific RFC section to view or edit it), `start` (Start a new RFC session to explore a problem with multiple proposed solutions, trade-offs, and open questions), `status` (Show current RFC session progress including section drafting status)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rfc-generator@claude-community` from `Benedixx/claude-rfc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 7
  },
